Quick couplers for excavators are generally classified as parts of machinery of heading 8431. Specifically, 8431.49 covers parts of machinery of headings 8426, 8429 and 8430. Excavators fall under 8429 (self-propelled shovels and excavators), so the relevant subheading is 8431.49, "Other" parts of 8429 machinery. Within it, 8431.49.9080 is the other-parts line, although there is a separate line, 8431.49.9095, in some versions.

Recent CBP rulings on OilQuick couplers (e.g., NY N302436) classified them in 8431.49.9095, with the 2022 HTS stating "8431.49.90 Other: 8431.49.9010 Of machinery of 8426... 8431.49.9080 Other." I am not certain of the exact statistical suffix. Under the current schedule, 8431.49.90 has statistical suffixes 8431.49.9010 and 8431.49.9095. I choose 8431.49.9095.

{"hts_code": "8431.49.9095", "reason": "The hydraulic quick coupler is an identifiable part suitable for use with excavators of heading 8429, so it falls under heading 8431 as an 'other' part in subheading 8431.49."}
